  "body": "## What's Changed\n* refactor: restructure TUI crate using The Elm Architecture (TEA) by @kurama in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/9\n* chore: add pre-commit configuration for cargo fmt and cargo clippy hooks by @kurama in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/12\n* 10 add pull request template by @kurama in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/15\n* docs: add Terminal Trove & Ratatui badge to README by @kurama in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/19\n* feat(search): back filter with ITAD API search instead of in-memory matching by @GhadiSaab in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/16\n* feat: support all ITAD regions with continent-grouped scrollable picker by @kurama in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/20\n* Add PgUp/PgDown/Home/End navigation for deal list by @Megatherium in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/21\n* chore: release 1.0.2 by @kurama in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/22\n\n## New Contributors\n* @GhadiSaab made their first contribution in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/16\n* @Megatherium made their first contribution in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/21\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/compare/v1.0.1...v1.0.2\n\n## What's Changed\n* refactor: restructure TUI crate using The Elm Architecture (TEA) by @kurama in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/9\n* chore: add pre-commit configuration for cargo fmt and cargo clippy hooks by @kurama in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/12\n* 10 add pull request template by @kurama in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/15\n* docs: add Terminal Trove & Ratatui badge to README by @kurama in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/19\n* feat(search): back filter with ITAD API search instead of in-memory matching by @GhadiSaab in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/16\n* feat: support all ITAD regions with continent-grouped scrollable picker by @kurama in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/20\n* Add PgUp/PgDown/Home/End navigation for deal list by @Megatherium in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/21\n* chore: release 1.0.2 by @kurama in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/22\n\n## New Contributors\n* @GhadiSaab made their first contribution in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/16\n* @Megatherium made their first contribution in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/21\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/compare/v1.0.1...v1.0.2\n\n## What's Changed\n* refactor: restructure TUI crate using The Elm Architecture (TEA) by @kurama in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/9\n* chore: add pre-commit configuration for cargo fmt and cargo clippy hooks by @kurama in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/12\n* 10 add pull request template by @kurama in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/15\n* docs: add Terminal Trove & Ratatui badge to README by @kurama in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/19\n* feat(search): back filter with ITAD API search instead of in-memory matching by @GhadiSaab in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/16\n* feat: support all ITAD regions with continent-grouped scrollable picker by @kurama in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/20\n* Add PgUp/PgDown/Home/End navigation for deal list by @Megatherium in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/21\n* chore: release 1.0.2 by @kurama in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/22\n\n## New Contributors\n* @GhadiSaab made their first contribution in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/16\n* @Megatherium made their first contribution in https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/pull/21\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kurama/dealve-tui/compare/v1.0.1...v1.0.2",
